    {
     "text": "Beat the remaining butter with the icing sugar and milk, and tint half pink.",
     "min": 6
    },
    {
     "text": "Cut both cakes in half and join one vanilla and one strawberry half with buttercream. Cover half pink and half white and pipe a seam. Cut into four portions.",
